[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3181.41, "timestamp": "00:53:01", "text": "当我多做一些单人内容时，效果就很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3183.03, "timestamp": "00:53:03", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3185.27, "timestamp": "00:53:05", "text": "还有一些兼职合作，你知道的。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3188.069, "timestamp": "00:53:08", "text": "并非一定要始终保持平衡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3191.589, "timestamp": "00:53:11", "text": "是的。是的。适合你的方法未必适合你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3194.39, "timestamp": "00:53:14", "text": "这意味着它对你有效。你。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3197.109, "timestamp": "00:53:17", "text": "是的。对我有效的方法并不意味着它对你也有效。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3200.23, "timestamp": "00:53:20", "text": "对你来说会很有效。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3203.829, "timestamp": "00:53:23", "text": "你明白我的意思吗？嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3206.75, "timestamp": "00:53:26", "text": "是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3209.51, "timestamp": "00:53:29", "text": "是的。你还想要什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3215.829, "timestamp": "00:53:35", "text": "你的生日马上就要到了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3219.109, "timestamp": "00:53:39", "text": "八月。哦，对，八月。你不会的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3222.309, "timestamp": "00:53:42", "text": "在印度，对吧？我的天啊。我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3225.43, "timestamp": "00:53:45", "text": "生日当天心情不好。我觉得什么时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3229.829, "timestamp": "00:53:49", "text": "你要出国吗？嗯，大概吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3232.309, "timestamp": "00:53:52", "text": "六月最后一周。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3235.79, "timestamp": "00:53:55", "text": "真是太令人难过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3239.75, "timestamp": "00:53:59", "text": "是的。我不知道。我们想你。是的。"}]